  "would-like": {"text": "Poproszę...", "say": "po-PRO-sheh ...", "note": "Literally \"I'll ask for\", the everyday polite way to order, the same for a man or a woman. The audio uses kawę (KA-veh), a coffee", "spoken": "Poproszę kawę", "filled": "Poproszę ⟦kawę⟧"},
