  "allergic": {"text": "Mam alergię na...", "say": "mam a-LER-gyeh na ...", "note": "Literally \"I have an allergy to\", the same for a man or a woman. Add the food: orzechy (o-ZHEH-hih) nuts, orzeszki ziemne (o-ZHESH-kee ZHEM-neh) peanuts, jajka (YAI-ka) eggs. The audio uses nuts", "spoken": "Mam alergię na orzechy", "filled": "Mam alergię na ⟦orzechy⟧"},
